Sir Richard,

The great survey begins. I enclose the articles. Send out the commissioners a=
nd let them be thorough =E2=80=94 the Crown's needs are pressing and the harv=
est of this work will be considerable.

Accurate returns, mind. I will not have the valuations padded nor pared.

Cromwell

